</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234241\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/b5/DFF_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/16?cb=20110203234241\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Phantasmal Harlequin\"><img alt=\"Phantasmal Harlequin\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110204000919\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"17\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Strange Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/a/ae/DFF_Strange_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/17?cb=20110204000919\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"><img alt=\"Idle Sky Pirate\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Soul of Destruction\"><img alt=\"Soul of Destruction\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>As we enter we see the worst cutscene of the game, where in a moment of weakness, Terra asks Vaan to kill her, and he has to talk her down, assuring her the side she's on doesn't matter, he saved her because it was right. Now it's time for the gateway. The opposition consists of a Phantasmal Girl, Phantasmal Harlequin, two Idle Sky Pirates, and the Strange Battle Piece, the Fleeting Flash. This time around the Flash has Iron Giant, which will cleave your Bravery in half every time she lands an HP attack. Not a huge problem though since she has no Bravery attacks to take advantage of your weakness. Enemies are Level 15, a bit tougher than before, but not a huge problem. A Cross Chain at C4 will chain all five of them for 25 KP. The two chests here hold a Soul of Destruction and our third Pink Tail.\n</p><p>Now we see another scene, the mind control Kefka had Terra on is broken entirely, as you can tell from her eyes now. Vaan tells Terra to find somewhere to hide until Chaos is gone, then he'll take her to see Cosmos and find out how to go home. Terra finally introduces herself to him as he departs, and we unlock another <a href=\"/story/reports/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Reports\">Report</a> to be covered on that page.\n</p><p>Head to the main menu, check your Mognet and buy some calendar upgrades from the PP Catalog, then prepare for Chapter 3.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"toccolours\" width=\"85%\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; margin:0 auto; text-align: center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align: center; border:solid 1px\"><b><a href=\"/story/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake\">Drake Clawfang's Dissidia 012 Walkthrough</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"10%\" style=\"border:solid 1px\" rowspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/story/012-treachery/prologue-chapter-1/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 1\">Previous page</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Treachery_of_the_Gods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" title=\"Treachery of the Gods\">Treachery of the Gods</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/story/012-treachery/prologue-chapter-1/\" title=\"Walkthrough:Dissidia 012 Final Fantasy/Drake/Part 1\">Prologue / Chapter 1</a> - <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</strong> - <a href=\"/story/012-treachery/chapter-3/\" title=\"